rrsync: pin the parent of existing receiver file arguments; without it an
upload onto an existing file fails with EPERM on the /proc/self/fd link.
https://github.com/RsyncProject/rsync/commit/92a2a09e3f (#1107, #1136)

--- a/support/rrsync
+++ b/support/rrsync
@@ -375,7 +375,7 @@
